2003|n|One who serves, or does services, voluntarily or on compulsion; a person who is employed by another for menial offices, or for other labor, and is subject to his command; a person who labors or exerts himself for the benefit of another, his master or employer; a subordinate helper. ; One in a state of subjection or bondage. ; A professed lover or suitor; a gallant.	a:149a,145,5;e1z,128,40;1s28,81,18~e1z,128,40;1s28,81,18;149a,145,5	n:e1z,75,1~e1z,75,1	N:2455,86,16~2455,86,16
