2020|a|of Set ; Fixed in position; immovable; rigid; as, a set line; a set countenance. ; Firm; unchanging; obstinate; as, set opinions or prejudices. ; Regular; uniform; formal; as, a set discourse; a set battle. ; Established; prescribed; as, set forms of prayer. ; Adjusted; arranged; formed; adapted.	j:ab1,58,4;hk,45,3;1siz,30,4;v7d,27,10;1ej4,24,9;478,24,9;1j81,21,10;29c6,19,2;2f3x,19,6;9kp,18,7;vlw,18,8;2frv,14,6;1wll,12,1;28qs,11,1;1dr2,10,1~28qy,3,30;2823,3,19;1mth,8,18;1j81,21,10;v7d,27,10;478,24,9;1ej4,24,9;vlw,18,8;pjm,7,8;5a3,2,8;9kp,18,7;2f3x,19,6;2frv,14,6;nk9,2,5;2fcc,2,5	e:2h7t,21,5;15ow,13,7;1by6,10,25~1by6,10,25;15ow,13,7;2h7t,21,5
